  "body": "Welcome to 37 Streamview Way, Long Bay. Designed with modern family living in mind, this substantial residence offers approximately 335m² of floor area, with five bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms and multiple living spaces thoughtfully arranged across two levels.\r\n\r\nStep inside to a welcoming interior where generous proportions, quality finishes and a practical layout create a comfortable setting for everyday family life. At the heart of the home is a beautifully appointed classic-style kitchen with integrated Miele appliances, complemented by a separate butler’s kitchen for added convenience.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a separate lounge at the entrance, flowing through to the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, with an internal-access garage and ensuite bedroom completing the layout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four bedrooms are complemented by an additional living area, providing flexibility for children, family relaxation or a second lounge. Ensuite and main bathroom facilities add convenience for everyday living.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Well-appointed Miele kitchen with integrated appliances, including refrigerator, oven, steam oven, coffee machine and plate warming drawer\r\n\r\n• Separate butler’s kitchen, ideal for additional preparation and everyday cooking\r\n\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining & living area for relaxed family living and entertaining\r\n\r\n• Separate ground-floor lounge, offering a quiet retreat or versatile additional living space\r\n\r\n• Built-in audio system in the open-plan living area, enhancing the atmosphere for family and guests  \r\n\r\n• Integrated smart home & security system with remote control of the automated security gate, garage door and lighting, together with multi-camera CCTV\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Warranty for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern convenience in mind, the home combines practical technology with comfortable family living. The smart home and security features provide convenient remote access and added reassurance, while the built-in audio system is well suited to entertaining in the open-plan living area.\r\n\r\nWith its generous proportions, flexible accommodation and well-considered layout, this home provides plenty of room for families to live, entertain and grow.\r\n\r\nLocated in the popular Long Bay community, 37 Streamview Way is well positioned for local amenities, schools, beaches and the surrounding coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or join us at the next open home.",
